{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> =\n  | MutationObserverIdleResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverLoadingResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverErrorResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n| MutationObserverSuccessResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L2340","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:2340"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result of a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"text","value":", and of the hooks built on it like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMutation"},{"type":"text","value":". Narrow it by\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"status"},{"type":"text","value":" or the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"is*"},{"type":"text","value":" flags to get the type of each state."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvariables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVariables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> =\n  | MutationObserverIdleResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverLoadingResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverErrorResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n| MutationObserverSuccessResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:2340](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L2340)\n\nThe result of a `MutationObserver`, and of the hooks built on it like `useMutation`. Narrow it by\n`status` or the `is*` flags to get the type of each state.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MutationObserverResult\ntitle: MutationObserverResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype MutationObserverResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> =\n  | MutationObserverIdleResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverLoadingResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n  | MutationObserverErrorResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>\n| MutationObserverSuccessResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:2340](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L2340)\n\nThe result of a `MutationObserver`, and of the hooks built on it like `useMutation`. Narrow it by\n`status` or the `is*` flags to get the type of each state.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n"}
